# A5 (THE FIVE-RESERVATION ADMISSION TEST): five concurrent 253,920-token prompts (each reserves 4,097 blocks at the full window: 5 x 4,097 = 20,485) on
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e-grow, whose KV pool is the production 19,968 plus the 2,168 blocks the shared history freed, rounded down to 64: 22,144 (QWEN36_MAX_TOKENS_ALL_USERS=1416704).
# The growth is this profile's own choice (QWEN_FAST_GDN_SHARED_HISTORY_KV_GROW=1 only marks it; serving_c2_contract checks the arithmetic at boot). The profile admits any request, so the gate
# runs TWO arms (memory-concurrent and memory-short), each its own container and its own attach. READ: the attach itself first: it must reach 'packed-any admission passed' at 262144 with the pool built
# at 22,144 blocks (a pool the DRAM cannot hold fails the attach or the first capture: record the ledger's free DRAM per chip at P7 and the failing phase; that is a FINDING about the growth, not a
# defect of the lever, and it ends this pack here, after E1's data is already in); then the memory plan: five sessions admitted at once with reservation 'fit' lines only (running <= 22,143 on
# every line), ZERO 'kv reservation hold' lines, every stream completes, the floor (free less stranded less estimate) at least 1.0 GB per chip with five live 262k seats and the trace
# region's largest free block at least 44 MB. Duration (estimate): two attaches 18 each + five cold 254k prefills one at a time about 45 min = about 90 min. Stop rule: a hold with a seat free, an
# attach failure, or a floor under 1.0 GB ends THIS pack (Z still runs).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the exact-GDN-memory pack (tp4/gdn-shared-history; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry:
# the cards are resolved at run time. ORDER.txt has the order, stop rules, minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1 stands for
# the combined window's one image (the integration step replaces it in every template of every pack); a commit of a file the image carries needs a new build and a new tag.
# The cards are under development: no agentstop, agentstart or hand-back job exists in this pack. The profiles are GATE ONLY: nothing here serves traffic.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-gdn4e-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-4e-grow
C2_GATE_PLAN=memory
C2_GATE_MEMORY_PROMPT=253920
C2_GATE_MEMORY_USERS=5
C2_GATE_JIT=record
